<h2>6. Managing and withdrawing consent</h2>
<h3>6.1 Cookie banner</h3>
<p>When first accessing the Website, the User is shown an informative banner where they may accept or reject the use of analytical cookies. The User&#x27;s decision is stored locally on their device through the &quot;cookie_consent&quot; element. The User may modify their preferences at any time by clearing the Website&#x27;s local storage from their browser.</p>
<h3>6.2 Browser settings</h3>
<p>Major browsers allow configuring cookie preferences, blocking or deleting them. The official links to each browser&#x27;s cookie settings are:</p>
<p>Google Chrome: support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647</p>
<p>Mozilla Firefox: support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop</p>
<p>Safari: support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/mac</p>
<p>Microsoft Edge: support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies</p>
<p>Opera: help.opera.com/en/latest/web-preferences/</p>
<h3>6.3 Specific opt-out for Google Analytics</h3>
<p>The User may install Google&#x27;s official add-on to opt out of Google Analytics on all websites visited: tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout.</p>
<h3>6.4 Consequences of disabling</h3>
<p>Disabling analytical cookies does not affect the operation of the Website. Refusing local storage may prevent preferences such as language or visual theme from being remembered.</p>
